[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114907114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758#issuecomment-4114907114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117758","id":4114907114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71RH_q","user":{"login":"TheFirstDeity","id":2649297,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDkyOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2649297?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity","html_url":"https://github.com/TheFirstDeity","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheFirstDeity/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T02:14:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T02:14:42Z","body":"It's so mean when the shader editor steals focus from the node shortcuts. They took the attention away from you, didn't they? And that made you feel hurt? I'm here to validate your emotions. I'm so sorry that that happened to you. I'm sobbing with sympathy for what you're going through right now. It must be so difficult. 😭","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114907114/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":3,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4115016434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758#issuecomment-4115016434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117758","id":4115016434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71Riry","user":{"login":"CSLRDoesntGameDev","id":126827743,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4883w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126827743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev","html_url":"https://github.com/CSLRDoesntGameDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T02:51:50Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T21:50:17Z","body":"been running into this for a few weeks and it seems to be stealing focus in general and has very little to do with shortcuts but that's a side effect. based on what i can tell, and what you said seems to be true, it's related to the shader editor opening up when the shader material is opened in the inspector. i couldn't repro it when the shader editor was fully closed however, only when the shader editor dock was open and collapsed.\n\nthere's seemingly no immediate way to break out of it as the CodeEdit grabs focus when the node is selected again because it opens when the node gets focus. one thing i noticed is you can get around this focus issue by right clicking the node and closing the context menu, but it still pops up when selecting a different node then using arrow keys to move the focus up.\n\nthis seems like an intended UX improvement, but this _may_ have been an oversight.\n\nedit: attempted to fix this in my build but it means the shader editor dock doesn't gain focus at all when popped up. i don't know what the intended behavior is and i'm no expert in the editor interface but i personally couldn't find a way to prevent the shader editor from stealing focus when it's already opened while also keeping the \"focus on open\" behavior","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4115016434/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4137166498","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758#issuecomment-4137166498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117758","id":4137166498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72mCai","user":{"login":"CSLRDoesntGameDev","id":126827743,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4883w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126827743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev","html_url":"https://github.com/CSLRDoesntGameDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CSLRDoesntGameDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-26T18:12:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-26T18:12:29Z","body":"following up on this after i experimented with it some more, what i found seems to be the same behavior as reported in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100152 (thats also suggested as a dupe of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99772..) and this issue seems like it's a side effect of the shader editor stealing focus when it shouldn't 😕-","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4137166498/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4183224104","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758#issuecomment-4183224104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117758","id":4183224104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75Vu8o","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T12:14:57Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T12:14:57Z","body":"This is extremely blocking and should be considered a bug. There is effectively no way to duplicate a node with a custom shader when selecting it for the first time, as your duplicate commands always go to the shader editor code.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6bd4373-2d47-41e5-a24e-76d6379eefbc","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4183224104/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4296147466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758#issuecomment-4296147466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117758","id":4296147466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABABICCg","user":{"login":"Infini-Creation","id":136735040,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCZpQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136735040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation","html_url":"https://github.com/Infini-Creation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T12:18:19Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T12:18:19Z","body":"Caught by this one today with v4.7.dev4.official [755fa449c]\n\nVery **annoying**, defintely not a feature but an issue ! (Or a \"bugture\".)\n\nJust _shader editor_ selected on the bottom, try to type a few thing in a script (completely unrelated by the way) then... this nasty _shader editor_ steal the focus and mess things up.\n\nIt does it pretty quickly **after** the autocompletion popup close, but not when you just type non _GDSCript_ things. Even when completion menu not actively used, like typing \"var some....\", you didn't have time to end \"thing\" ... cursor jump to the _shader editor_.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4296147466/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4361431032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117758#issuecomment-4361431032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117758","id":4361431032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA_Yn-A","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-01T20:17:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T20:18:37Z","body":"I agree, clicking on a node in the scene dock should not focus on the shader editor. Its being opened indirectly through unfolded resources in the inspector, but it shouldn't steal focus. You would expect to be able to use shortcuts to interact with the node you just clicked on.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4361431032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]